 • Cognitive Credit , a provider of corporate credit data, raised $40m led by Summit Partners . axios.link/4zGjwFY 

 • Wilde , a maker of protein chips from chicken and bone broth, raised $40m in Series A funding led by S2G Investments , per Axios Pro . axios.link/4BjoaeN 

 • Mach9 , an SF-based design software startup, raised $34m in Series A funding. First Round Capital and Bessemer Venture Partners led, joined by Prudence and Quiet Capital. axios.link/4hYQE5U 

 ⚡ Optivolt , an SF-based developer of an intelligence layer for solar, raised $32m in Series A funding. VXI Capital led, joined by RA Capital, Valo Ventures, and Atlas Innovate. axios.link/3UEE5DS 

 • Enact Intelligence , a French robotics startup, raised $30m in pre-seed funding from redalpine, Notion Capital, firstminute Capital, Yann LeCun, and Arthur Mensch. axios.link/3UIv1Oi 

 • Beyond Vision , a Portuguese dronemaker, raised €28m led by Índico Capital Partners and Lince Capital . axios.link/3VWPVcV 

 • Hive , a Canadian event marketing platform, raised US$27m in Series B funding led by Frontier Growth . axios.link/4yxzy48 

 • Nirva , a developer of wearable AI personal companions, raised $25m from firms like Lightspeed and South Park Commons. axios.link/4zMteqq 

 🚑 Arctic Therapeutics , an Icelandic developer of treatments for dementia and skin diseases, raised $21.5m led by Pekron , Sanos Group , Kaldbakur g, and Landvættir . axios.link/4jAfhHs 

 • Fort Robotics , a Philadelphia-based provider of robot safety solutions, raised $20m led by Tiger Global with Mark Cuban Cos. participating. It's in the process of going public via a reverse merger with Newbury Street II Acquisition Corp (Nasdaq: NTWO). fortrobotics.com 

 • Firstwork , an SF-based automated onboarding platform, raised $15m in Series A funding. Earlybird Venture Capital led, joined by Legion VC, Deel Ventures, Gradient, and YC. axios.link/3W3zyv4 

 • ScribeUp , a Cambridge, Mass.-based provider of embedded recurring bill management for financial institutions, raised $13m in Series A funding. Curql led, joined by Mucker Capital and Service Ventures. axios.link/3WDoLIa 

 • Azoma , an agentic commerce optimization platform, raised $11.2m in Series A funding. Puma Growth Partners led, joined by dunnhumby, Twin Path, MaRS IAF, Rank Ventures, and Ignite Ventures. axios.link/4z34Twu 

 • Mika Games , a gaming financing startup, raised $10m led by Flint Capital . axios.link/4k7FqgK 

 🚑 BioStack , a provider of clinical data infrastructure for medical AI, raised $9.5m in seed funding from Peak XV, Afore Capital, DCVC, Emerson Collective, SV Angel, Verdict Capital, Streamlined Ventures, and YC. axios.link/4yHbcoB 

 • Pascal , a Watertown, Mass.-based developer of solid refrigerant tech for cooling systems, raised $8.5m from Sazze Partners, LB Investment, and KDB Silicon Valley. axios.link/4kf7b74 

 • Opply , a U.K.-based CPG ops automation platform, raised $7.5m. Chalfen Ventures led, joined by Index Ventures, Anthemis, Entrepreneurs First, In This Together, and Ventures Together. axios.link/4erpDFZ 

 🌎 Kodama Systems , an SF-based developer of autonomy tech for forestry, raised $7m. Konvoy Ventures and Breakwater Ventures led, joined by Blue Forest Asset Management, NYA Ventures, Breakthrough Energy Ventures, Congruent Ventures, Dangerous Ventures, and M1C. axios.link/4enb6uW 

 • PreScalar , an SF-based advanced manufacturing data platform founded by Cruise alums, raised $7m in seed funding, per Axios Pro . Dynamo Ventures and BMW i Ventures led, joined by Blue Wire Capital, Uplift Ventures, and Antler. axios.link/3VX5660 

